'''Galarian Perrserker''' (Japanese: '''ガラルニャイキング''' ''Galarian Nyaiking'') is a {{ct|Metal}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} expansion.

