==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Fusion Strike|Galarian Perrserker|181}} from the {{TCG|Fusion Strike}} expansion.
*'''Dig Up''' is an Ability that first appeared as a [[Pokémon Power (TCG)|Poké-Power]] on {{TCG ID|EX Dragon Frontiers|Quagsire δ|21}} from the {{TCG|EX Dragon Frontiers}} expansion.
*{{m|Metal Claw}} is a [[move]] in the Pokémon games that Perrserker can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

